The wands spoiler
(http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/341/wan2-341.html#polymorphing) says
that there is a 0.30% chance of a non-magical tool polymorphing into a
magical one.

Yeah, the chance is incredibly low, but it's not zero...

Probably not worth the effort if you *really* need that magic marker
(use unicorn horns in that case), but.. what else are you going to do
with all the non-magical tools? If you're polypiling tons of junk
anyway, you might as well throw in some tools and hope for that 0.30%
chance.



